gggg-unit SD Maid SE FOSS Patches
================================

Independent third-party patch bundle compatible with Morphe.
Maintainer: gggg-unit
Project-specific adaptation and packaging changes: 2026-10-21
Source: https://github.com/gggg-unit/sdmaid-se-morphe-patch
License for project-specific patch code and scripts: GNU GPL version 3;
