This project is not affiliated with or endorsed by d4rken, SD Maid SE,
the Morphe project, Doom/rushiranpise, or Paresh Maheshwari.
Names identify the target app, compatibility, and credited references.
No trademark rights are granted or claimed.

The FOSS adaptation targets UpgradeRepoFoss.Info.isPro. Its fingerprint,
validation scripts, source metadata automation, and packaging differ from
the referenced Google Play patches. No original SD Maid APK, artwork,
logos, translations, or documentation are distributed in the bundle.

